Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In the deepest ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The bottom of the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They turn me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be crazy not to follow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow where you lead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They turn me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn me into phantoms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I follow to the edge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And fall off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everybody leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If they get the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:03:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my chance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I get eaten by the worms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And weird fishes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Picked over by the worms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And weird fishes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird fishes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:04:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird fishes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah I, I'll hit the bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the bottom and escape
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I, I hit the bottom
